Subject: KAFKA 2.13-3.3.1 Zookeeper issue

Hello Kafka Community,

We are currently using Kafka version kafka_2.13-3.3.1 on a Linux Ubuntu ser=
ver. This setup has been running successfully for the past two years to int=
egrate two PLM [3DExperience and Teamcenter] applications.

In recent days, we have encountered recurring issues in the Zookeeper servi=
ces, and it leads to bring down the zookeeper service within 10 days:

Every 12 hours/24 hours, Zookeeper logs/ terminal Console the following war=
ning:

WARN Unexpected exception (org.apache.zookeeper.server.NIOServerCnxn)
EndOfStreamException: Unable to read additional data from client, it probab=
ly closed the socket: address =3D /127.0.0.1:40312, session =3D 0x103e76486=
150001
                at org.apache.zookeeper.server.NIOServerCnxn.handleFailedRe=
ad(NIOServerCnxn.java:163)
                at org.apache.zookeeper.server.NIOServerCnxn.doIO(NIOServer=
Cnxn.java:326)


We have already tried adjusting parameters in zookeeper.config (such as max=
ClientCnxns and session timeouts), but the changes are not reflected as exp=
ected.

Request:

Could you please advise on:

The root cause of the recurring EndOfStreamException every 12 hours or 24 h=
ours once and how to resolve this issue.

Thank you for your guidance and support.

Thanks and Regards,
THIRUVARASAMOORTHI R


