Subject: Seeking Best Practices: Identifying Pod IPs for K8s/OCP Clients on
 On-Prem Kafka to Mitigate Rogue Client Spams
To: users@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="00000000000083a7e006528d2e40"
